    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 18 September 2008, the Fund further resolved to transfer the management and control of all companies within the Erol Aksoy Group to itself"^^xsd:string,
        "on 14 September 2001, the Fund resolved to recover 726,122,000 Turkish liras from the former shareholders"^^xsd:string .

